+The owner’s 22 October 2026 dialogue direction (`owner-dialogue-quality-1792682200`) applies here: write original exchanges with particular agendas, changes of status and room for silence or humour. Reject imitation assembled from swagger, mechanical puns or ornamental profanity. A character’s complaint should concern something they want from the listener. The [editorial brief](EDITORIAL_VOICE.md) carries the standing rule and the distinction between text-only rhythm review and an actual performed read.
 
 These are editorial decisions drawn from the interviews, not claims about how the reference films’ creators would make Loopforge. The [voice guide](EDITORIAL_VOICE.md) governs the prose; [the episode](OPENING_EPISODE.md) puts the decisions into a playable sequence.
